//   - JsonSchema (+ typed slots for `type` / `properties` / `required` / `items`, `additional_keywords`).
//   - Future: validate / schema_to_type / emit — Deferred (1); `Outcome<…>` (json.dag #3184 / DECISIONS I).
//
